      "title": "Discover Careers",
      "description": "Careers – Human Resources Skip to content Human Resources Careers About Who is HR? Our Strategic Plan News Events Working at Tech Employee Homepage Learning & Development Telework Agreements Employee Relations Global Human Resources Payroll Time & Labor Compensation & Classification Student Employment Leading at Tech People Leaders Performance Management Organizational Design & Effectiveness Change Management Benefits Engagement Learning & Development Forms & Guides Search Toggle search interface Menu Toggle extended navigation Discover Careers at Georgia Tech People Focused. Tech Powered. At Georgia Tech, our mission is simple: Internationally recognized for teaching, research, innovation, and service excellence, Georgia Tech develops exceptional leaders who advance technology and improve the human condition. Explore Open Roles For internal applicants, log into OneUSG Connect >> Click the Recruiting Self Service title >> Then, click the Apply for Jobs title Discover Careers at Georgia Tech People Focused. Tech Powered. At Georgia Tech, our mission is simple: Internationally recognized for teaching, research, innovation, and service excellence, Georgia Tech develops exceptional leaders who advance technology and improve the human condition. Explore Open Roles For internal applicants, log into OneUSG Connect >> Click the Recruiting Self Service title >> Then, click the Apply for Jobs title At Georgia Tech Your Journey Matters For more than 137 years, the people of Georgia Tech have imagined and created solutions for a better future. The innovative culture and leadership continue, for Progress and Service for all. Its mission and strategic plan are focused on making a positive impact on the lives of people everywhere. For technical support, please contact the Shared Services Center at (877) 251-2644 or oneusgsupport@usg.edu At Georgia Tech Your Journey Matters For more than 137 years, the people of Georgia Tech have imagined and created solutions for a better future. The innovative culture and leadership continue, for Progress and Service for all. Its mission and strategic plan are focused on making a positive impact on the lives of people everywhere. For technical support, please contact the Shared Services Center at (877) 251-2644 or oneusgsupport@usg.edu % Satisfaction with Georgia Tech as a place to work. Active staff, research, and academic faculty. No. 1 Fastest-growing university over the last decade. Innovating at Georgia Tech Georgia Tech is an engine of economic development for the state of Georgia, the Southeast, and the nation. With $1.37 billion annually in research awards across all seven Colleges and the Georgia Tech Research Institute (GTRI), Georgia Tech is among the nation’s most research-intensive universities. Learn more at Georgia Tech's Website Innovating at Georgia Tech Georgia Tech is an engine of economic development for the state of Georgia, the Southeast, and the nation. With $1.37 billion annually in research awards across all seven Colleges and the Georgia Tech Research Institute (GTRI), Georgia Tech is among the nation’s most research-intensive universities. Learn more at Georgia Tech's Website Explore Your Next Career Opportunity Staff Georgia Tech offers careers for staff positions throughout the campus, located in administrative units and in the colleges and schools. View Staff Opportunities Explore job openings in the Georgia Tech Alumni Association Explore job openings in the Georgia Tech Foundation Academic Faculty Georgia Tech has faculty positions dispersed among 29 schools within the colleges of Business, Computing, Design, Engineering, Liberal Arts, and Sciences. Current faculty opportunities may be found by visiting the websites of each college or school. Explore Colleges and Schools View Faculty Opportunities Research Faculty Research positions are available in the Georgia Tech Research Institute (GTRI) and in various colleges and schools. GTRI hires, equips, and supports the best researchers in the most recognized fields of science and technology. View Research Opportunities at GT Careers Portal Go to GTRI Jobs Page Students Georgia Tech is here to support student employees, their managers, and the departments that hire over 9,000 students across the Institute. Explore Student Employment Resources Go To Campus Jobs Board Explore Your Next Career Opportunity Staff Georgia Tech offers careers for staff positions throughout the campus, located in administrative units and in the colleges and schools. View Staff Opportunities Explore job openings in the Georgia Tech Alumni Association Explore job openings in the Georgia Tech Foundation Academic Faculty Georgia Tech has faculty positions dispersed among 29 schools within the colleges of Business, Computing, Design, Engineering, Liberal Arts, and Sciences. Current faculty opportunities may be found by visiting the websites of each college or school. Explore Colleges and Schools View Faculty Opportunities Research Faculty Research positions are available in the Georgia Tech Research Institute (GTRI) and in various colleges and schools. GTRI hires, equips, and supports the best researchers in the most recognized fields of science and technology. View Research Opportunities at GT Careers Portal Go to GTRI Jobs Page Students Georgia Tech is here to support student employees, their managers, and the departments that hire over 9,000 students across the Institute. Explore Student Employment Resources Go To Campus Jobs Board What makes Georgia Tech a top choice for your career? Innovation. Impact. Collaboration. At Georgia Tech, our people drive change, challenge ideas, and build the future — together. Join us and make a difference. Perks & Benefits Educational Assistance Learning & Development Our Strategic Plan What makes Georgia Tech a top choice for your career? Innovation. Impact. Collaboration. At Georgia Tech, our people drive change, challenge ideas, and build the future  — together. Join us and make a difference. Perks & Benefits Educational Assistance Learning & Development Our Strategic Plan Your Purpose, Our Community At Georgia Tech, you’re valued and empowered to make an impact together. Hear from the people who make Tech great. \"At Georgia Tech you can tell that everyone truly cares about one another.\" There is a strong sense of support, and people often express their appreciation for each other. In this role, I also get to be student facing, and I really enjoy my time with students. They’re brilliant and deeply care not just about themselves but about the world around them. Kay Martinez | Director of Employee Development \"Working at Georgia Tech has broadened my understanding of service.\" I feel very proud to support the next generation of leaders and help them, however I can, in achieving their goals. Everyone at the Institute is united in purpose and upholds the values that ‘students are our top priority’, and I find that incredibly inspiring. Elizabeth Geiger | Communications Officer I \"In three words, I'd describe Tech as innovative, collaborative, and purpose-driven.\" We are about fostering creativity and driving meaningful change. In our culture of teamwork, faculty, staff, and students come together to support and uplift one another. Everything we do is guided by our commitment to excellence, making our work rewarding and meaningful. Dante Christmas | Unit Administrative Officer Your Purpose, Our Community At Georgia Tech, you’re valued and empowered to make an impact together. Hear from the people who make Tech great. \"At Georgia Tech you can tell that everyone truly cares about one another.\" There is a strong sense of support, and people often express their appreciation for each other. In this role, I also get to be student facing, and I really enjoy my time with students. They’re brilliant and deeply care not just about themselves but about the world around them. Kay Martinez | Director of Employee Development \"Working at Georgia Tech has broadened my understanding of service.\" I feel very proud to support the next generation of leaders and help them, however I can, in achieving their goals. Everyone at the Institute is united in purpose and upholds the values that ‘students are our top priority’, and I find that incredibly inspiring. Elizabeth Geiger | Communications Officer I \"In three words, I'd describe Tech as innovative, collaborative, and purpose-driven.\" At Georgia Tech, we’re about fostering creativity and driving meaningful change. In our culture of teamwork, faculty, staff, and students come together to support and uplift one another. Everything we do is guided by our commitment to excellence, making our work rewarding and meaningful. Dante Christmas | Unit Administrative Officer Employee News #WeCanDoThat Career Boosters Program Empowers Professionals to Grow In the ever-evolving landscape of professional development, standing still is not an option. At Georgia Tech, the message is clear: Growth is a journey . . . READ FULL ARTICLE A Look Back at 2025 Record-breaking fundraising, long-term projects realized, and unprecedented growth and impact . . . READ FULL ARTICLE Education Assistance Programs Pave a Tuition-Free Path Forward Brittany McCormick is a go-getter. She’s always wanted to get the most out of life, whether that means advancing in her career, . . . READ FULL ARTICLE Cato Celebrates 30 Years at Georgia Tech We agree — working at Georgia Tech is pretty great! Meet Johnny Cato, a General Maintenance . . . WATCH VIDEO Employee News #WeCanDoThat Career Boosters Program Empowers Professionals to Grow In the ever-evolving landscape of professional development, standing still is not an option. At Georgia Tech, the message is clear: Growth is a journey . . . READ FULL ARTICLE A Look Back at 2025 Record-breaking fundraising, long-term projects realized, and unprecedented growth and impact . . . READ FULL ARTICLE Education Assistance Programs Pave a Tuition-Free