      "title": "Join Our Team",
      "description": "Join Our Team - Georgia Tech Alumni Skip To Main Navigation Skip To Content Skip To Section Navigation Skip To Footer Give Now Student Programs Calendar News Volunteer Give Now Close Menu GT Alumni Social Media Student Programs Calendar News Volunteer Events & Programs Georgia Tech vs Stanford - Tailgate Events Calendar Travel Student Programs Homecoming Weekend 40 Under 40 Roll Call Gold & White Honors Gala Pi Mile 5K Road Race Alumni Golf Tournament Social in the City President's Summer Tour Game Watching Home for the Holidays Ramble the Night Student Send-Offs Groups & Networking Regional Networks Affinity Groups Georgia Tech Connect Get Involved Volunteer Opportunities Graduating Students & New Alumni Stories & Traditions GT Alumni Magazine Stories Magazine Full Issues Traditions & Icons Class Notes & Alumni Updates Let Us Wrecksplain Resources & Benefits Career Development Partner with Us Digital Fan Gear Tech Marketplace About Us About the Georgia Tech Alumni Association Alumni Statistics Association Staff Board of Trustees Join Our Team Home About the Georgia Tech Alumni Association Join Our Team In This Section Toggle Section Navigation About the Georgia Tech Alumni Association Join Our Team Alumni Statistics Association Staff Board of Trustees GOLD Advisory Council Georgia Tech alumni are unique. Over 220,000 strong, Tech alumni are successful as entrepreneurs, managers, scientists, engineers and leaders in organizations around the globe. The Alumni Association has a team of 45 professionals, committed to supporting GT alumni throughout their careers. Annually, we offer thousands of programs, services and events to increase alumni engagement and expand their connection with the Institute. Come be a part of Georgia Tech – an amazing history and bright future. The Georgia Tech Alumni Association is a separate, legal, 501(c)3 not-for-profit recognized by Georgia Tech and the State of Georgia as an affiliated organization. The Alumni Association is committed to the mission, \"champion and serve its alumni and the Institute through programming and engagement that fosters lifelong relationships and philanthropic support.” Open Positions Gift Processing Coordinator For Alumni Job Seekers Visit the job section in Georgia Tech Connect to view listings of job opportunities at hundreds of employers. Posted by fellow Yellow Jackets, find your next career opportunity. GT Connect Our Sponsors 190 North Ave NW Atlanta, GA 30313-2220 +1 (404) 894-2391 Quicklinks About the Alumni Association Calendar Volunteer Student Programs Georgia Tech Athletics Be a Sponsor Give Now © Georgia Tech Alumni Association 2024 Privacy Policy Accountability Request the Ramblin' Wreck"
