      "description": "Work With Us | Georgia Tech Foundation GTF Donor Portal Contact Search Georgia Tech Foundation Website Access mobile menu About Work With Us Stories Our Impact Resources Financial Statements Annual Reports Governance Data Privacy Policy GTF Donor Portal Give to Tech About Work With Us Stories Our Impact Resources Financial Statements Annual Reports Governance Data Privacy Policy GTF Donor Portal Give to Tech About Georgia Tech Foundation Work With Us Careers at Georgia Tech Foundation Since 1932, the Georgia Tech Foundation has been dedicated to promoting higher education and supporting the Georgia Institute of Technology. We're a non-profit corporation that receives, administers, and distributes contributions to enhance\n one of the nation's leading institutions. Support Education Dedicated Team Career Development Available Opportunities There are no open positions right now. Please check back soon. Get in Touch Interested in joining our team? We'd love to hear from you. Contact Us GIVE TO TECH GTF DONOR PORTAL BOARD MEMBER PORTAL ALUMNI PROFILE UPDATES Georgia Tech Foundation 760 Spring Street, NW, Suite 400 Atlanta, GA 30308 (404) 894-5072 © Georgia Institute of Technology Georgia Tech Links GEORGIA TECH LINKS Georgia Tech Homepage Campus Map Directory Offices Institute Employment GEORGIA TECH RESOURCES Offices & Departments News Center Campus Calendar Special Events Sustainability Institute Communications LEGAL Emergency Information Legal & Privacy Accessibility Accountability Accreditation Close"
